{
 "id": "0f4b749b-3c53-4d7e-92db-2c0c757d9b7d",
 "type": "manga",
 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "“Seijo-sama no Omake” to Yobareta kedo, Watashi wa Omake dewanai You desu."
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "『聖女様のオマケ』と呼ばれたけど、わたしはオマケではないようです。～全属性の魔法が使える最強聖女でした～"
   },
   {
    "en": "Even though I was called \"the Saints' Bonus,\" it appears I'm not just an extra. In fact, I was the strongest saint capable of using all elemental magic"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Saya Shinoyama is suddenly summoned to another world along with her classmates. While her classmates are treated as saints and treasured, Saya is treated as a nuisance and an \"extra\" to the saint, leading a hard time in the Kingdom of Dunie where she was summoned. One day, the younger prince of the great nation of the Wyell Empire extends a helping hand! It is later revealed that she has the cheat-level ability to use magic of all attributes, and she becomes the saint of the empire and plays an active role. The tale of Saya's turbulent transfer to another world begins in style! \"Those who treated me like a nuisance, now you know my true worth!\"",
   "ja": "クラスメイトと共に突然異世界に召喚されてしまった篠山沙耶。\n一緒に召喚されたクラスメイトは聖女として大事にされる一方、\n沙耶は聖女様の〝オマケ〟として厄介者あつかいされ、\n召喚されたドゥニエ王国でつらい日々を送っていた。\nそんなある日、大国・ワイエル帝国の皇弟殿下が救いの手を差し伸べる！\n実は全属性の魔法が使えるチート級の能力を持っていた事がのちに判明し、\n帝国の聖女となり、大活躍していく沙耶の、波乱万丈な異世界転移物語、堂々開幕！\n「わたしを厄介者扱いしてきたやつら、逃した魚の大きさを知るがいい!!」"
  },
